{"id":"n73914-2-7","stage":5,"title":"자그마하다 · 微小","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73914-2-7-1","ko":"유민이는 너무 예민한 것 같아.","zh":"裕敏好像太敏感了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민이는","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"유민이는","audio":"/audio/727cddb4c6676098ab15.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예민한","meaning":"敏感","explanation":"예민하다：敏感；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"예민하다","audio":"/audio/07e96f3c93ffb0ed67f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68449","senseId":"3","lemma":"예민하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"07e96f3c93ffb0ed","term":"예민하다","zh":"敏感","audio":"/audio/07e96f3c93ffb0ed67f6.mp3","entryId":"68449","definition":"对刺激所做出的反应或感觉过于敏锐。","pronunciation":["예ː민하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/6c87146b384c3a65925e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73914-2-7-2","ko":"맞아. 자그마한 일에도 너무 신경을 쓰더라고.","zh":"对啊，连一点小事她都会过分在意。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자그마한","meaning":"微小","explanation":"자그마하다：微小；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"자그마하다","audio":"/audio/e87a6823b8314b1f06f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73914","senseId":"2","lemma":"자그마하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일에도","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"신경을","meaning":"神经","explanation":"신경：神经；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"신경","audio":"/audio/601d03a22ce3fa90ef0a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13994","senseId":"2","lemma":"신경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓰더라고.","meaning":"痛苦","explanation":"쓰다：痛苦；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16488","senseId":"2","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"e87a6823b8314b1f","term":"자그마하다","zh":"微小","audio":"/audio/e87a6823b8314b1f06f1.mp3","entryId":"73914","definition":"没什么大不了的。","pronunciation":["자그마하다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带有某种内容的情况或事实。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"601d03a22ce3fa90","term":"신경","zh":"神经","audio":"/audio/601d03a22ce3fa90ef0a.mp3","entryId":"13994","definition":"对某事的感觉或想法。","pronunciation":["신경"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"痛苦","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"16488","definition":"因有所挂记，而感到厌烦或困惑。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]}],"audio":"/audio/418a128dec0009e1ebe2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.289,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73914","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":157,"sequenceScore":3.1157,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["裕敏好像太敏感了。","对啊，连一点小事她都会过分在意。","你看过网上热议的那张UFO照片吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["裕敏好像太敏感了。","对啊，连一点小事她都会过分在意。","你看过网上热议的那张UFO照片吗？"],"answer":1}]}
